---
title: Maple Frappuccino
servings: 2
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
image: https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2016/08/staba-top.png
---

In a #blender, blend together @ice{4%cups}, @coffee{1%cup}(alternatively, 4 shots espresso), @maple syrup{1/2%cup}, @almond extract{2%tsp}, @milk{1%cup}, @nutmeg{dash}, and @vanilla bean ice cream{2%scoops}(can replace with 2 tsp vanilla extract with some more milk and ice) until smooth. Top with @?caramel sauce{}, @?cinnamon sugar{}, and @?whip cream{} as desired.